Focus Notes 📝

A minimal, keyboard-friendly Markdown notes app.

Focus Notes is a distraction-free writing application for creating, editing, searching, and organizing notes. It combines a simple sidebar with a Markdown editor and live preview, keeping your writing workflow fast and focused.

✨ Features

- Create & Delete Notes — Manage notes with a simple interface.
- Markdown Editor — Write with headings, lists, links, and code blocks.
- Preview Mode — Switch between Markdown source and rendered content.
- Instant Search — Search note titles and content as you type.
- Local Persistence — Keep notes saved in your browser using LocalStorage.
- Last-Edited Timestamps — Track recent changes.
- Keyboard Shortcuts — Navigate and work efficiently.
- Responsive Design — Designed for desktop, tablet, and mobile.
- Privacy-Focused — Notes remain in your browser unless you add a synchronization service.

